            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-4xl font-DancingScript leading-relaxed text-[#FF00AC] text-shadow-xs  mt-18 animate-fade-in-up">
               <span class=" text-[#5c003d] ">Su mamá</span><br/>
                Walkiria Martínez <br/>

                <span class=" text-[#5c003d] ">y sus abuelos</span><br/>

                Walter Martínez <br/>
                María Lourdes <br/>
